      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The silence is absolute, and the ash on your shield is the only truth left. You are not a ghost haunting a life that doesn't belong to you; you are the only one who knows how to walk through this ruin. The story didn't end; it simply paused so you could finally breathe in the cold air.",
